# ServiceLog — environment variables
# Copy to `.env` and fill in real values. `.env` is gitignored and must never be committed.
#   cp .env.example .env     (PowerShell: Copy-Item .env.example .env)

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Gemini API — server-side only. Read exclusively in lib/gemma.ts (Batch C).
# NEVER prefix this with NEXT_PUBLIC_ — that would expose it to the browser.
# Create a key at https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
GEMINI_API_KEY=

# Open-weight Gemma model served by the Gemini API.
# Default: Gemma 4 26B-A4B (MoE, ~4B active params — fast on shared free-tier capacity).
# Override to try e.g. gemma-4-31b-it without touching any code.
GEMMA_MODEL=gemma-4-26b-a4b-it

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Database — PostgreSQL on Neon, for local development and production.
# Copy the connection string from the Neon console (Connection Details) and
# paste it below unchanged. Do not hand-edit the parameters it arrives with.
#
#   DATABASE_URL  the runtime connection. Used by the application (lib/db.ts)
#                 and, when DIRECT_URL is empty, by the Prisma CLI. On Neon this
#                 is the pooled (-pooler) endpoint, so a serverless function does
#                 not hold a dedicated database connection per request. This is
#                 also the only database variable Vercel needs.
#
#   DIRECT_URL    optional. Neon's direct (non-pooled) connection string. The
#                 Prisma CLI (prisma.config.ts) prefers it for `prisma migrate`,
#                 which takes locks a pooler may not serve. Leave it empty if
#                 you only have the pooled string: the CLI then falls back to
#                 DATABASE_URL.
#
# Both are read from the environment and nothing is hardcoded. Leave DIRECT_URL
# out of Vercel: migrations are applied from your machine, not from the Vercel
# build.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
DATABASE_URL=
DIRECT_URL=